---
import '../styles/global.css';

interface Props {
  title: string;
  customMaxWidth?: string;
}

const { title, customMaxWidth = "max-w-3xl" } = Astro.props;
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="ko">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width" />
    <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/favicon.svg" />
    <meta name="generator" content={Astro.generator} />
    <title>{title}</title>
    <!-- Pretendard Web Font -->
    <link rel="stylesheet" as="style" crossorigin href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/orioncactus/pretendard@v1.3.9/dist/web/static/pretendard.min.css" />
  </head>
  <body class="bg-[#FAFAFA] text-zinc-900 font-['Pretendard'] antialiased selection:bg-black selection:text-white min-h-screen flex flex-col">
    <header class={`w-full ${customMaxWidth} mx-auto px-6 py-12 flex items-center justify-between`}>
      <a href="/" class="text-xl font-bold tracking-tight hover:opacity-70 transition-opacity">
        하자 <span class="font-light text-zinc-400">Haja</span>
      </a>
      <nav class="flex gap-6 text-sm font-medium text-zinc-500">
        <a href="/playground" class="hover:text-black transition-colors font-semibold text-blue-600">놀이터(실행기)</a>
        <a href="/docs/intro" class="hover:text-black transition-colors">문서</a>
        <a href="https://github.com/soumt-r/haja-document" target="_blank" class="hover:text-black transition-colors">GitHub</a>
      </nav>
    </header>
    
    <main class={`flex-grow w-full ${customMaxWidth} mx-auto px-6 py-10 flex flex-col`}>
      <slot />
    </main>

    <footer class={`w-full ${customMaxWidth} mx-auto px-6 py-12 text-sm text-zinc-400 border-t border-zinc-200 mt-20`}>
      <p>한국어로 시작하는 쓸만한 객체지향 프로그래밍 언어, 하자(Haja)와 함께해요.</p>
    </footer>
  </body>
</html>
